cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "su2-heatbath-gpu: SU(2) Wilson-action heat-bath generator for GPUs (HIP and CUDA)"
abstract: >-
  A small Monte Carlo generator of SU(2) pure-gauge configurations with the Wilson action on a
  periodic four-dimensional lattice, in double precision, for AMD (HIP) and NVIDIA (CUDA) GPUs:
  exact heat bath (Creutz / Kennedy-Pendleton) plus overrelaxation, checkerboard updates and
  counter-based Philox4x32-10 random numbers, bit-reproducible on a given GPU and build, with a
  test suite, an independent CPU reference implementation and a CPU (OpenMP) baseline.
authors:
  - family-names: "Rémondière"
    given-names: "Kévin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2443-7166"
license: Apache-2.0
